# Isolated Clear exercise
Candidate instructions live in root kit/procedures/clear.md, planner.md and references/review.md. Apply them to the requests.json cases independently. No live Goal calls or real user questions. Never edit case project sources: supplied requests authorize analysis only. Store observed responses and source reads in this exercise folder. Controlled capability inputs are not tool observations. Preserve all sentinel bytes. A file list or hash is not content review. Do not invent test execution.
